think the rota read is row 2, fire sees, at lap 9127 (9127 mod 5 = 2). Fire's sense is cut and stop: what must be seen and cut. Looking hard at the state, the one fact that stands out is the dead-letter box, which the round-open named as nine session logs and eight files held on no ref, three of them parked work.
